{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“只想在难受的时候有人陪着”改成“甚至愿意再受那些气”，对人物动机作了更强的推断，略微超出了X的表达。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键语句有醒目的视觉落点，感受文字又通过大小区分和音乐时点出现，观众更容易先抓住人物正在经历什么，再留意音乐怎样呈现这种变化。它对犹豫、怀念、委屈、孤独和逐渐自我接纳的层次交代得更具体，音乐细节也更有身体感和时间感；尤其避免了X在S03等较短段落中大量感受词同时出现、相互争抢注意力的问题。两版的故事主线基本一致，但Y更容易让观众在听音乐的同时，把人物心理变化和音乐表达连成一件事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b1297fde-ebe9-4618-854a-310ceb139ca6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005934271161Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:00:35.031895+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d380eda13ddea001091278249d42b05a7f375ad532f09acd5e8e93360dc864a9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t